  "method": "Offline render of the released 808/909 DSP engines assembled by bd808.build()/bd909.build() in bd909_host. Fresh engine per section; four-on-the-floor triggers at exact quarter-note intervals derived from a 128 BPM instrument-tempo fixture. Two bars of 808 defaults, one bar each of 909 TUNE 0 and 127, four bars of TUNE 0–127, then four bars of built-in Mackie SAT 0–95 with TUNE held at 127. ATK is fixed at 0 throughout the 909 sections to expose the pitch envelope. Tune Depth remains default 64, PITCH stays 49 in every 909 section, LOW/HIGH stay neutral 64. One common gain, no external effects or samples, no added gaps, 35 ms section-end fades. Not a physical Octatrack recording.",
